<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's spot rupee</p>
<p>rates in the kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.47		 41.52</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	68.80		 68.90</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.90		 24.05</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.360		 0.362</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.03		 11.05</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.28		 11.30</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.06		  1.08</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.50 pct	    2.70 pct</p>
</text>
